WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.143 --> 00:00:16.024
followed Mei-Li through the city.

2
00:00:16.044 --> 00:00:18.545
"Chang'an is so big!"

3
00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.086
said Vinnie.

4
00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:21.947
Mei-Li nodded.

5
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:25.268
"Chang'an is the capital of the Tang Dynasty.

6
00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:28.090
The famous Silk Road begins here.

7
00:00:29.171 --> 00:00:31.592
Almost all trade moves along the Silk Road."

8
00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:38.890
"Oh, that's why there are so many different people here," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:39.971 --> 00:00:43.172
They passed a very high wall with a guarded gate.

10
00:00:43.192 --> 00:00:48.294
"That's the East Gate," said Mei-Li.

11
00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:52.036
"We have four gates, but we can use only three."

12
00:00:52.056 --> 00:00:54.957
"Why?" asked Vinnie.

13
00:00:54.977 --> 00:00:59.259
"The North Gate is only for the emperor," said Mei-Li.

14
00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:01.760
"Where is Mandy?"

15
00:01:03.216 --> 00:01:06.199
"She's wandered off again," sighed Vinnie.

16
00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:10.122
"Don't worry, she does this all the time."

17
00:01:11.743 --> 00:01:15.546
Meanwhile, the monkey ran fast out of the square.

18
00:01:16.847 --> 00:01:19.850
Then it climbed up on the roof of a building.

19
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:24.013
"Come here," she called to the animal.

20
00:01:25.314 --> 00:01:28.717
The monkey shyly moved down to a windowsill.

21
00:01:29.758 --> 00:01:32.180
Mandy carefully climbed up some steps.

22
00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.961
She tried to grab the monkey.

23
00:01:36.122 --> 00:01:39.084
But she tripped and tumbled through a door.

24
00:01:39.104 --> 00:01:47.430
"I'm terribly sorry," she apologized to a startled young man.

25
00:01:48.651 --> 00:01:51.573
He was sitting cross-legged on a low couch.

26
00:01:52.773 --> 00:01:56.776
In front of him was a low table covered with open books.

27
00:01:56.796 --> 00:01:58.757
"May I help you?"

28
00:01:59.358 --> 00:01:59.898
he asked.

29
00:01:59.918 --> 00:02:03.720
"Well, yes," Mandy said.

30
00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.121
"I'm looking for a monkey."

31
00:02:06.141 --> 00:02:08.422
"Are you sure it's here?"

32
00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:09.782
he laughed.

33
00:02:11.122 --> 00:02:12.002
Mandy nodded.

34
00:02:12.022 --> 00:02:13.863
"I chased it here."

35
00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:16.844
She explained the trainer's behavior.

36
00:02:18.264 --> 00:02:19.704
The man nodded sadly.

37
00:02:19.725 --> 00:02:22.345
"We should treat all living things kindly.

38
00:02:23.065 --> 00:02:24.006
That's Buddha's way."

39
00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:26.066
"Who are you?"

40
00:02:26.986 --> 00:02:27.747
asked Mandy.

41
00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:29.747
"My name is Jinying.

42
00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:32.688
I am Master Yuan's son," he replied.

43
00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.001
"How come you aren't at your party?"

44
00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:37.322
she asked.

45
00:02:38.323 --> 00:02:40.584
"My father is a little too eager to celebrate.

46
00:02:41.545 --> 00:02:45.668
My exams are not over yet," laughed Jinying.

47
00:02:45.688 --> 00:02:49.130
"I still have many Chinese characters to memorize."

48
00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:52.352
"How many do you have to know?"

49
00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:53.973
asked Mandy.

50
00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.076
She glanced at his open book.

51
00:02:58.276 --> 00:03:03.360
She saw a vertical row of Chinese characters on one side of the page.

52
00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.663
Next to each character was a series of smaller characters.

53
00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:13.647
"I memorize about two hundred a day," replied Jinying.

54
00:03:13.667 --> 00:03:16.149
"Each character has a different meaning."

55
00:03:16.169 --> 00:03:20.113
"How many do you have to learn altogether?"

56
00:03:20.853 --> 00:03:21.734
Mandy asked.

57
00:03:21.754 --> 00:03:24.456
"Over four hundred thousand."

58
00:03:26.578 --> 00:03:27.539
Jinying sighed.

59
00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.381
Mandy was shocked.

60
00:03:30.401 --> 00:03:34.024
"I won't disturb you then," she said.

61
00:03:34.944 --> 00:03:37.685
"Wait!" Jinying stood up and stretched.

62
00:03:37.705 --> 00:03:39.546
"I need a break.

63
00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:41.407
I'll help you find your monkey."

64
00:03:43.588 --> 00:03:47.549
Meanwhile, Vinnie stopped and stared at the crowded streets.

65
00:03:47.569 --> 00:03:50.550
"This is like New York!"

66
00:03:51.191 --> 00:03:51.851
he cried.

67
00:03:51.871 --> 00:03:53.431
"Excuse me?"

68
00:03:54.052 --> 00:03:54.832
asked Mei-Li.

69
00:03:54.852 --> 00:03:58.153
"Uh, nothing," he said.

70
00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:04.556
Chang'an was busy and noisy with people, wagons, and animals.

71
00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:11.124
When he and Mei-Li reached the market, Vinnie was even more surprised.

72
00:04:12.324 --> 00:04:16.928
There were many lanes, and each lane sold only one product.

73
00:04:16.948 --> 00:04:22.792
"Wow! There's one lane for oil, and one lane for vegetables.

74
00:04:24.012 --> 00:04:32.238
And even one," Vinnie laughed, "for roast duck with the head still attached?"

75
00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:34.740
"My favorite!"

76
00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.161
said Mei-Li.

77
00:04:36.181 --> 00:04:39.626
"The duck seems to be looking at me!"

78
00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:42.009
"But it's delicious!"

79
00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:43.470
she replied.

80
00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.132
"Let's try some."

81
00:04:46.194 --> 00:04:47.075
Vinnie gulped.

82
00:04:47.896 --> 00:04:50.799
"Maybe I should go and find my sister."
